ODE 0.5.0 (@ode), after shipped-library.patch, computing in our build's
dReal (csrc/ode/include/ode/sse.h): the shipped library's single-precision
SSE arithmetic under flush-to-zero and denormals-are-zero
(docs/behavior/physics-library.md 7, docs/behavior/physics-harness.md 7).
dReal is that type in C++ (a float in C); the math macros give dReals, so
no float arithmetic escapes it; a dDISTANCE of dReals; a conditional of a
dReal and an integer zero, and dReals passed to printf-like functions,
spelled for a class. Applied by Bazel to the release (MODULE.bazel); ODE's
code is used under its BSD licence option.

